# ============================================================
# Large data — never commit raw or processed dataset files.
# Source qmds/Rs reference these locally; site-rendered HTML
# already includes everything readers need.
# ============================================================

# Final-project data tree (USASpending, Grants.gov, NIH/SAMHSA terminations, etc.)
info_management/final_project/data/

# Knowledge Mining hackathon raw data dump (TidyTuesday-style job ads)
knowledge_mining/hackathon/jobads/
knowledge_mining/hackathon/jobads.zip
knowledge_mining/hackathon/job_data/

